      "message": "can\u0027t be done in the kernel only: the ioctls are already translated\nthere, but the camera blob inlines ExynosJpegEncoder accessors, so the\nv4l2_format layout inside the object must match (17 planes). I also\ntried the stock libhwjpeg blob, the camera provider segfaults with it.",
