      "writtenOn": "2026-11-26T10:43:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Using the correct headers and adjusting your kernel to them would fix it without any blob patches and also prevent potential incompatibilities outside of this specific one.",
      "parentUuid": "e4fd479b_e32416ca",
      "revId": "538c21985fe79773f20a497f89e76249feb5274b",
